version dev
--------------------------
* inc-fock for direct SCF
* add DF SCF
* add SU-rsDFT
* non-hermi DF JK
* more PDFT functionals
* add symmetry for SCF

version 0.5 (Mar 3, 2025)
--------------------------
* SU-PDFT update, change pdft backend to pyscf, print SU-PDFT energies
* allow modifying diis space, diis driver

version 0.4.3 (Jun 23, 2022)
--------------------------
* MO-based 2pdm; faster PDFT
* split xc in PDFT

version 0.4.2 (Mar 28, 2022)
--------------------------
* EMP2(0)
  + fast implementation with biortho
  + enable TBLIS in EMP2 
  + Fix bug when vap

version 0.4.1 (Oct 15, 2021)
--------------------------
* PAV-SUHF and PAV-SUDFT with `noiter`
* PAV-SUMP2
* fix bug in 1pdm trace of doublet, triplet, ...
* SUHF 2pdm
* SU-DDFT and SU-PDFT

version 0.4.0 (Jul 27, 2021)
--------------------------
* DeltaSCF
  + add mo_occ, move util -> suscf
  + MOM
* Restart SUHF from
  + UHF chkfile
* PT2 and NOCI
  + determinant overlap <0|P|ia>, <0|P|ia,jb>
* SUPDFT decomposition

version 0.3.2 (May 28, 2021)
--------------------------
* CASDFT
  + Cremer's CAS+fDFT, CAS-DFT2
  + move autocas to pyAutoMR
* experimental self-consistent SUKS

version 0.3.1 (May 11, 2021)
--------------------------
* DFT
  + subdirectory dft, copied from pyscf.dft and pyscf.lib.dft, to modify TPSS (deprecated)
  + fine/ultrafine grid
  + trunc='fd': eta = (rho_ref / gamma)**(1/3)
  + introduce nref, ncore
  + fcDFT made right
* EMP2 draft
* fix bug in tofch
* guess
  + modify UHF strategy
  + add stability check for UHF
* fix bug in conv check
* using PySCF's vhfopt, 30% faster. 1pdm made faster.

version 0.3 (Mar 19, 2021)
--------------------------
* DFT
 + libxc's Colle-Salveltti functional (1988mod, not the 1975 one)
 + SUHF+fDFT (MSS type)
 + SUHF+fcDFT (not work ...)
* generate not only alpha/beta NO but also total NO
* decompose X energy from SUHF, draft class PDFT
* guess.mix

version 0.2 (Feb 03, 2021)
--------------------------
* density, natural orbitals for SUHF
* add tofch
* packed dm to accelerate J,K matrices
* fragment guess
* level shift

version 0.1 (Nov 21, 2020)
--------------------------
* SUHF
* SUHF+DFT
* DIIS


